@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
actor User
participant Dialog
participant Discovery
participant Site
participant ListService
participant Repo
User -> Dialog : Search keyword
Dialog -> Discovery : search(store, keyword)
Discovery -> Site : GET search page
Site --> Discovery : result links
Discovery --> Dialog : List<Hit>
User -> Dialog : Confirm selected product
Dialog -> Discovery : inspect(url)
Discovery -> Site : GET detail page
Site --> Discovery : identity / package / price
Discovery --> Dialog : Preview (not saved)
User -> Dialog : Add to automatic collection
Dialog -> Discovery : confirm(preview, quantity)
Discovery --> Dialog : verified Result
Dialog -> ListService : add(result)
ListService -> Repo : saveAtomic(product, price, settings)
Repo --> Dialog : save result
note over User,Repo
Next startup / refresh collects enabled sources.
Search and preview alone do not register products.
end note
@enduml
